8:3: forma-kind: `unwritten` reads as a shadow: write its kind, `unwritten: box-shadow` or `unwritten: text-shadow`
9:30: forma-kind: a text shadow has no spread: <offset-x> <offset-y> [<blur>]
10:29: forma-kind: a text shadow is never `inset`
11:28: forma-kind: a text shadow is one shadow, not a list
12:27: forma-kind: write the colour: CSS's default, currentcolor, is not one a box shadow holds
13:28: forma-kind: a shadow's length: the kernel takes only px in a shadow until QUEUE's item "`rem`/`em` where the kernel still takes only `px`"
14:28: forma-kind: two to four lengths: <offset-x> <offset-y> [<blur> [<spread>]]
15:29: forma-kind: one colour, and lengths in px (unitless zero)
16:3: forma-under-kind: only a colour may vary by an axis `under scheme=dark`: the kernel picks a length's slice without knowing the scheme
18:31: forma-kind: a blur radius is never negative
19:22: forma-kind: `10000000000000000000000000000000000000000px` is past the lengths a shadow holds
20:26: forma-kind: `1`: a shadow's length says px (unitless only zero)
21:32: forma-kind: `shadow.box` is the other row's shadow
24:3: forma-kind: `card.unwritten` reads as a shadow: write its kind, `card.unwritten: box-shadow` or `card.unwritten: text-shadow`
25:26: forma-kind: `shadow.box` is a shadow token, not a length
26:28: forma-kind: `shadow.box` is a shadow token, not a number
